# bulk artifacts, rebuildable from the scripts in this directory; the scored CSVs and every log
# are committed.
#   feat_<year>.parquet  -> `python3 f44_build.py all`   (~6 min)
#   w43.csv              -> `python3 f43_walk.py`        (~35 min, checkpointed in w43_state.json)
#   x67.csv              -> `python3 f43.py join`        (~1 min)
feat_*.parquet
w43.csv
x67.csv
f45_bf_book_*.csv
